PRINTER HARDWARE SPECIFICATION     GANTRY 9->12mm CONVERSION  
BELT TENSION                       FIRMWARE CONFIGURATION  
CHAMBER HEATING SYSTEM             CHAMBER INSULATION  
SAFETY CIRCUIT (Duet -> PLC, R1)   MODBUS RTU (Duet <-> PLC)  
PLC PROGRAM STRUCTURE              DUET FILES  
POWER SUPPLIES                     CIRCUIT PROTECTION  
CABLE GLANDS                       TERMINAL SCHEDULE  
UMBILICAL CABLE SUPPORT            WATER COOLING LOOP  
GRANITE BED                        IMMEDIATE NEXT STEPS  
PROCUREMENT                        RASPBERRY PI / DISPLAY  
ACCELEROMETER / INPUT SHAPING      FILAMENT HANDLING  
IO ALLOCATION SUMMARY              KEY LEARNINGS & PRINCIPLES  
TOOLS & RESOURCES  

Typical reasons to fetch: full terminal schedule wiring, PLC tag addresses and  
block structure, glazing/sealant specification, exact part numbers and order  
references, historical reasoning behind a settled decision.  

